# Frontend

- `main.tsx` mounts `App`. No client-side router.
- Call the backend only through `api.ts`. Poll generate jobs with `generateStatus`; cancel with `cancelGenerate`.
- Header: UI locale EN/FA/DE. Speech language stays in the left Delivery rail.
- Settings `⋯`: Models, Voices, Dict, Guide, bubble theme, Reset. Keep Import / History / Projects in the header.
- i18n: add the same key to `en`, `fa`, and `de` in `i18n.ts`.
- Layout tokens live in `styles.css` (`--space-*`, light/dark). Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Chat inputs: `dir="auto"`. Composer tags use `Icon` + `tagIcon()`, not one shared pause glyph.

Studio layout and chrome: `docs/architecture.md` (UI section) and `README.md` header tools.
